<section id="about" class="bg-ink px-6 py-24 text-paper lg:px-8">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[280px_1fr]">
		<div class="mx-auto h-56 w-56 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl lg:mx-0">
			<img
				src="/images/founder-brock.png"
				alt="Brock Livermore, founder of Morium"
				class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top"
			/>
		</div>

		<div>
			<span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-accent-300 uppercase">
				Why Morium exists
			</span>
			<p class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl leading-snug font-bold sm:text-3xl">
				I run Livermore Auto Detailing, a mobile detailing business, and got tired of
				juggling texts, spreadsheets, and missed follow-ups. I built Morium to actually
				run my own business, then realized every detailer deserves the same thing.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-6 text-base font-semibold text-paper/80">
				Brock Livermore, founder of Morium
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
